oads many of the  communities are cut off during the snow  during the very harsh winters as this  country gets so we're racing against the  clock we're racing against winter to  stave off uh hunger from the drought and  hunger from the economic crisis  well the donor conference for  afghanistan's getting underway in geneva  today we've heard that  earlier how confident are you uh that  enough money will be given  i i'm hoping that the the you know the  international community you know will  will  you know reach into their pockets and  support afghanistan at this time uh  um it's it's it's critical uh for our  shared humanity it's critical for the  humanitarian effort that in their  greatest time of need that the  international community stands alongside  the women and children and men of  afghanistan whose lives have been  upended through no fault of their own  marielle mccarty there from the world  food programme in kabul thank you very  much  thank you
 

